A compact, space-saving design with plenty of headroom for a comfortable night's sleep under the stars. Features a large vestibule for storage and access to your gear, and an integrated tarp that protects the tent when not in use.
<p><span style="font-size:">Freestanding 4-season 1-person tent with large vestibule. Quick-pitch design, adjustable vents,PFC-free inner. TGO Magazine Highly Recommended for solo backpacking.</span>
